# How tests are named and handled

- Every test name starts with the Jira key and AC id: `"FIX-<n> AC<k>: <behaviour>"`
- Prefer one test per acceptance criterion
- Never delete or weaken a failing test to make CI pass; fix the code, or flag the AC as wrong
- Unit tests live next to the code in `src/` as `*.test.ts`; browser tests live in `tests/` as `*.spec.ts`
